      "correct": "4",
      "solution": "⇒ 101 × 101 + 99 × 99\n\n⇒ (100 + 1)² + (100 – 1)²\n\nAs we know,\n\n⇒ (a + b)² = a² + b² + 2ab\n\n⇒ (a – b)² = a² + b² – 2ab\n\n⇒ (100)² + 1² + 2 × 100 × 1 + (100)²+ 1² – 2 × 100 × 1\n\n⇒ 10000 + 1 + 10000 + 1\n\n⇒ 20002",
